    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="0976" n="940" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v05/pg940"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1969-76v05">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume V</ref>,
                    United Nations, 1969–1972. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been
                    revised. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 925 (date of
                            correction: January 2, 2013)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The cross reference under Robert Curran to document 468 was
                        removed.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 934 (date of
                            correction: November 17, 2018)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The cross reference under Peru to document 2989 was corrected to document
                        298.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">3. <ref target="#d279">Document 279</ref>, footnote 4,
                            Page 489 (date of correction: August 17, 2021)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The meeting between Secretary of State Rogers and President Chiang
                        occurred on August 3. The memorandum of conversation for that meeting was
                        sent via telegram from the Embassy in Taipei on August 8.</item>

                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
